#: front-end/brikcontrol/checks/class-brikpanel-brikcontrol-bot-traffic-check.php:171
msgid "Bot traffic"
msgstr "Трафик ботов"

#: front-end/brikcontrol/checks/class-brikpanel-brikcontrol-bot-traffic-check.php:191
