"изменились."

#: front-end/push/class-brikpanel-push-sender.php:1323
msgid ""
"An administrator can create new keys under WooCommerce > Settings > "
"BrikPanel > Notifications. Each phone then turns notifications back on by "
"itself the next time BrikPanel is opened on it."
